{"id":"58aed4b78aae5919","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-null-class-no-random.md","title":"零测度有效闭类没有 ML 随机成员","display":"thm-null-class-no-random — 零测度有效闭类没有 ML 随机成员","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-null-class-no-random","aliases":["20-thm-null-class-no-random"],"display":"thm-null-class-no-random — 零测度有效闭类没有 ML 随机成员","chapter":"11","section":"11.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 11.3.1（正向）；正测度随机成员推论的本地逆否证明","source_pdf_pages":[222],"source_printed_pages":[191],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-random]]","[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","[[20-df-ml-test]]","[[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]","[[20-cor-positive-class-random-member]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-null-class-no-random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-null-class-no-random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-null-class-no-random — 零测度有效闭类没有 ML 随机成员"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.3.1（正向）；正测度随机成员推论的本地逆否证明"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>222</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>191</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"238731f42b452fa7\" href=\"?note=238731f42b452fa7\" title=\"20-df-random\">20-df-random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f911a6b1b63f977\" href=\"?note=0f911a6b1b63f977\" title=\"20-df-ml-test\">20-df-ml-test</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3e87bcedc6718afa\" href=\"?note=3e87bcedc6718afa\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-measure\">20-thm-closed-class-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58f8766635c79a79\" href=\"?note=58f8766635c79a79\" title=\"20-cor-positive-class-random-member\">20-cor-positive-class-random-member</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"238731f42b452fa7\" href=\"?note=238731f42b452fa7\" title=\"20-df-random\">20-df-random</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0f911a6b1b63f977\" href=\"?note=0f911a6b1b63f977\" title=\"20-df-ml-test\">20-df-ml-test</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3e87bcedc6718afa\" href=\"?note=3e87bcedc6718afa\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-measure\">20-thm-closed-class-measure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"58f8766635c79a79\" href=\"?note=58f8766635c79a79\" title=\"20-cor-positive-class-random-member\">20-cor-positive-class-random-member</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}null-class-no-random}\\vdash\n\\mu(C)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X\\in C\\ \\neg\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}null-class-no-random}\\vdash\n\\mu(C)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X\\in C\\ \\neg\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向：取可计算二进制树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\">\\(C=[T]\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_m=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in T\\cap2^m}[\\sigma]\">\\(U_m=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in T\\cap2^m}[\\sigma]\\)</span>。各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_m\">\\(U_m\\)</span> 是可统一计算的有限 clopen 类，其有理测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_m\">\\(q_m\\)</span> 递减至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(C)=0\">\\(\\mu(C)=0\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(n)=\\min\\{m:q_m\\le2^{-n}\\}\">\\(p(n)=\\min\\{m:q_m\\le2^{-n}\\}\\)</span>；每次搜索都停止，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 全可计算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(U_{p(n)})_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\((U_{p(n)})_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 是覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的 ML 检验，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 没有 ML 随机成员。</p>\n<p>反向：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(C)&gt;0\">\\(\\mu(C)&gt;0\\)</span>，正测度随机成员推论给某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in C\">\\(X\\in C\\)</span> 为 ML 随机，与右侧矛盾；测度非负使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(C)=0\">\\(\\mu(C)=0\\)</span>。这里不在 Hypothesis 中先假定零测度，因而等价式同时适用于正测度和零测度有效闭类。空类亦满足两端。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.3.1 给正向；反向为已列推论的本地逆否证明。印刷页 191；PDF 第 222 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-random","status":"resolved","id":"238731f42b452fa7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-random]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-ml-test","status":"resolved","id":"0f911a6b1b63f977","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-ml-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-closed-class-measure","status":"resolved","id":"3e87bcedc6718afa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-cor-positive-class-random-member","status":"resolved","id":"58f8766635c79a79","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-cor-positive-class-random-member]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-ml-test]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]；see [[20-cor-positive-class-random-member]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-random","status":"resolved","id":"238731f42b452fa7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[